      "duration": "10 minutes",
      "activity_content": "1. Launch the 'Guess the Word' game: Write the sentence 'My grandma preserves homemade jam every autumn, she puts it in sealed glass jars and stores it in the fridge to keep it fresh for months' on the whiteboard, ask students to guess the meaning of the underlined word 'preserves' and share what hints in the sentence helped them guess. 2. Introduce the lesson topic: Explain that the hints hidden in the surrounding text are called 'context clues', and today we will learn how to use context clues to determine the meaning of unknown words in reading."
    },
