        "teacher_action": "Assign 3 practice problems: 1. $\\int x e^{2x} \\, dx$; 2. $\\int x^2 \\sin x \\, dx$; 3. $\\int \\arctan x \\, dx$. Walk around to give guidance, then invite students to show solutions on the board, point out and correct common mistakes (wrong u selection, sign error, missing constant of integration, wrong boundary evaluation)",
        "student_action": "Solve problems in pairs, check each other's work, correct mistakes, and summarize the standard steps of applying integration by parts"
      },
      {
