      "activity_content": "The instructor presents a daily dispute: 'Xiao Li helped neighbor Uncle Wang move furniture last weekend. After the work was done, Uncle Wang promised to give Xiao Li 500 yuan as a reward, but later refused to pay. Is Uncle Wang's promise enforceable?' All students vote by show of hands, the instructor introduces the theme of the class, and points out common confused points sorted from the pre-class quiz."
