        "Divide students into 4 groups, each assigned a typical clinical case: 1) EGFR-mutant non-small cell lung cancer resistant to first-generation EGFR-TKI; 2) Advanced melanoma resistant to anti-PD-1 immunotherapy; 3) Triple-negative breast cancer with acquired resistance to neoadjuvant chemotherapy; 4) Chronic myeloid leukemia resistant to first-generation imatinib",
