    "Process and Method: Through role-play and primary source jigsaw analysis, improve students' critical thinking and evidence-based historical interpretation ability.",
    "Emotional Attitude and Values: Understand that unfair peace based on winner-takes-all logic plants seeds of new conflict, and cultivate awareness of advocating equal negotiation to resolve international disputes."
  ],
  "key_points_and_difficulties": {
    "key_points": "Competing interests of Allied powers that shaped the Treaty of Versailles; multi-faceted consequences of the treaty for 20th-century global order.",
