    "Step 3: Rule out other major historical construction periods: The Han Dynasty extended the Great Wall further west for trade route protection, but most of its original wall also did not survive intact; smaller later dynasties only completed minor repairs, not large-scale new construction that forms the bulk of the current wall.",
