      "3. Take first-order conditions (FOCs) for optimum, setting partial derivatives to zero: (i) ∂ℒ/∂C1 = 1/C1 - λ = 0 → 1/C1 = λ; (ii) ∂ℒ/∂C2 = β/C2 - λ/(1 + r) = 0 → β/C2 = λ/(1 + r).",
