        "Limited partnerships (LP) and limited liability partnerships (LLP) offer limited liability to non-managing partners: their liability is capped at the amount of their capital investment, and personal assets are protected from most business claims",
        "Liability exposure is spread across multiple owners rather than falling on a single person"
      ]
    },
    "management": {
