{
  "core_definition_of_banduras_self_efficacy": "Bandura’s concept of self-efficacy describes a domain-specific, subjective belief an individual holds about their own capability to successfully execute the specific actions required to achieve a desired goal, which is distinct from general self-esteem, raw skill, or past performance alone.",
