  "overall_relationship_summary": "Self-efficacy acts as a core upstream driver of motivation for goal achievement: it shapes what goals people are motivated to pursue, how much effort they dedicate to pursuit, how resilient they are through setbacks, and ultimately their likelihood of reaching their goals. Differences in self-efficacy explain why two people with the same level of skill can have drastically different levels of motivation and goal success."
}

